Provenance
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The benchmark implementation, tasks, rubrics, and synthetic release datasets
are works prepared for AvalancheBench. The construction and provenance of the
synthetic datasets are described in docs/dataset-card.md. No Snowflake customer
data is included. Publication remains subject to release-owner and legal approval.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components and data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The CATC capability snapshot is derived from the LM Arena leaderboard dataset
(`lmarena-ai/leaderboard-dataset`), revision
d25aabda0010d1986a11988e5cb0a748053ce02b, retrieved 2026-09-17.
Source: https://huggingface.co/datasets/lmarena-ai/leaderboard-dataset/tree/d25aabda0010d1986a11988e5cb0a748053ce02b
LM Arena licenses this data under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ . The bundled snapshot
is an extracted subset with AvalancheBench model mappings and an anchor added.
That data retains CC BY 4.0; the project's Apache-2.0 license does not replace it.

The runtime installs Snowflake Connector for Python (Apache-2.0) from PyPI and
uses the official Python container image. These components are not vendored and
retain their own licenses. Dataset document and image provenance is described
in docs/dataset-card.md. The release owner retains dataset rights approval;
final repository publication remains subject to legal review.
